  - `ConcreteSpec/Spec/Surface0.lean`: added `IdentBody`/`Identifier`, `StringEscape`/`StringBody`, `LongestMatch`, and `DigitRun`/`DecimalInteger` judgments; updated the module header.
  - `Concrete/Lex.lean`: added total scanners, `_sound`, `_complete`, and uniqueness theorems for all four pieces, plus accepted/refused `decide` examples; updated the module header.
  - `scripts/proofs/axioms.golden`: 15 new lines, all belonging to the new declarations and using no axioms beyond `propext`; no existing line changed.
  - `changelog.d/2026-11-08-lexer-tokens.md`: records the changes and stack dependency.

